Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.04,0:00:05.04,Serif,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964.5,147)\fad(1023,807)\blur1.8\c&H000000&\1a&H22&}January 6, 2026 \N— New Aincrad, 22nd Floor —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His fast-acting mind is one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.39,0:00:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you start napping now, it's gonna\Nbe hard to get to sleep tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's three days of winter break left\Nand your homework won't finish itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon finished hers before\Nheading back home to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just saying I'm so sleepy, poor thing.\NIt's probably because the room's too warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.81,0:00:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to turn down the heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the heat; it's the masters\Nof the sleep skill over there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well that figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:00:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been working hard on his project\Never since he got back from GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that gizmo for Yui he\Ndemoed the other day at Egil's?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the mechaphonics?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's called mechatronics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.79,0:01:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.43,0:01:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, he's napping\Nlike there's no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's making me feel sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.95,0:01:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
