Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, guys, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Y 'all don't have to come here\Nevery time you're on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's classier places\Nin town you could go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.91,0:03:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is plenty classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared to your shop in Aincrad, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't listen to him. I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place was a rip-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half that junk was papier-mâché.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.23,0:03:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.57,0:03:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was letting you stay there for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Spill It, what's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just, seeing you like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.63,0:03:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look anything like\Nthe Assault Team's top players.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right back at you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, on that note, I bet you've\Nplayed MMORPGs for a long time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I played so much, I met the Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in-game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She used to live in the U .S.,\Nand we fell for each other hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:04:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A year later, she was here,\Nrunning the place with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Y 'all never know what life's\Ngot planned for you. Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Klein heard that story,\Nhe'd pop a blood vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next big step was getting\Nourselves a pair of NerveGear rigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when the time came, we\Ncould only pre-order one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember we played some game\Nto see who'd get to try it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it was me who cracked\Nthe seal on it, not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The assault team was the only ticket out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I joined up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I wanted was to get back\Nto this place and to my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to get back to my family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what kept me alive in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and the assault team, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet every player in Aincrad felt\Nthe same way about going home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't that what motivated you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's complicated\Nbetween me and my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:05:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's why there\Nwere a couple times in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.35,0:05:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there I almost forgot\Nwhat I was fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I felt like I\Ndidn't belong anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real and virtual were both dead ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, I met Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.45,0:05:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gave me something I could come home to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A place that felt more like a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.45,0:05:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Than anything I ever\Nhad in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I knew once SAO was cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our cabin would be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I knew deep down\Nthat one day, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have a home again with Kirito and Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what finally gave\Nme the strength to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gave me hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of Aincrad kiddies, the mod's\Njust posted some info on the next update.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.15,0:05:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mostly typical stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to be adding\Nnew weapons and sword skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.11,0:06:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're also going to be unlocking\Nfloors 21 to 30 in New Aincrad. Boom.
