Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.31,0:06:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we beat the boss on Floor 21, we have\Na chance to buy that log cabin again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, but there's been a ton of\Nlittle changes to New Aincrad lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.59,0:06:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sucked to get our hopes up just\Nto find our cabin's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it would, but I know it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be waiting for us,\Njust like how we left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, y 'all better get a move on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Update goes live Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:37.68,0:06:42.15,Serif,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,142.5)\fad(530,520)\blur0.6}December 24, 2025 \N— Alfheim, Gnome Airspace —
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.68,0:06:42.15,Serif,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964.5,147)\fad(530,520)\blur1.8\c&H000000&\1a&H22&}December 24, 2025 \N— Alfheim, Gnome Airspace —
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seiya, Sha, Lindo, Ashina,\NBart, Amy, or Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ha! Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about to punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it to floor 22!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're hanging around because\Nof the teleport gate, don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can activate it.
