Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:11:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.61,0:11:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Asuna, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes for you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's daring us to stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make some more tea,\Nand it'll wake us up right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it stopped snowing\Nwhile we were sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it really came down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, have you heard the news? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, about Second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you haven't heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of\Nrare item or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:11:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Er, wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:11:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the name of a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's not their handle,\Nit's more like a nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this player's so bad-ass,\Nsomeone called him Zekken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name caught on and there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means absolute sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimate sword's better, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, this player's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, when did you first\Nhear about this second person?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.77,0:12:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess maybe the first time was\Naround New Year's or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe a week or so ago? Oh, duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.51,0:12:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains why you're so\Nout of the loop about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been at your family's\Ncompound in Kyoto this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was having a good time,\Nbut you had to bring that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to the rich girl\Nrebelling against her cushy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A drag is exactly what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.37,0:12:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to sit on my knees in a\Nkimono all day greeting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought my Amusphere along,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thinking I could dive at night\Nwhile everyone was asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.99,0:13:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guesthouse I was in\Ndidn't have Wi-Fi. Fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.85,0:13:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You even listening? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? S-sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered something lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were your folks trying to\Nhook you up with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget I said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.57,0:13:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.77,0:13:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, anyway, is this tough new player a PK?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something? Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.27,0:13:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a duelist, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were they in any tournaments? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.75,0:14:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those players are total noob.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling they might have\Nconverted over from another game,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should see their skill stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how on floor 24 there's that tiny
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.93,0:14:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little island just north of the main town?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one with the huge tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, every day at three o 'clock,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you-know-who shows up under that tree,\Nwaiting to take on any challenger one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.91,0:14:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeken started by posting\Nthis opponent's wanted
