Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? They lost? All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One after the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.34,0:14:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of them managed to chip\Noff more than 30% of Zeken's HP.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.53,0:14:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how good Zekken is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:15:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who thought a newbie to the\Ngame could fly as good as that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.11,0:15:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took me at least six months to learn\Nhow to fly and fight at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.29,0:15:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm still learning stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.81,0:15:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you fight Zekken too? Not even.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.17,0:15:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I watched one duel and I\Nknew I didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to know what it was like,\Nwhy don't you ask Liz and Leafa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took Zekken on yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fought and lost\Nlike a couple of champs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.31,0:15:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good learning experience, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pretty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, back to Zekken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this player is as strong as you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.53,0:15:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's only a matter of time before\Nthere are no more challengers to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a pretty cool prize\Non the line, don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of rare item or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, it's nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:16:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever beats second will\Nget an original sword skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.47,0:16:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a special move that's\Nsupposed to be super strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An original sword skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What type?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many hits?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a general skill\Nfor a one-handed sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.75,0:16:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Head combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, 11?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strongest original sword skill being\Nused right now, how many hits does it have?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.33,0:16:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be the one General Eugene\Ndeveloped, the Volcanic Blazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be an eight-hit combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't passed it on to anyone\Nelse yet, and I doubt he ever will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that explains why so many players\Nkeep lining up to challenge Second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have any of you seen this\Nsword skill in action?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.81,0:16:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard Second demoed it on the\Nfirst day of the duels, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.47,0:16:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently it blew mines left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since then, it hasn't been\Nused in any of the fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the reason for\Nthat's because there hasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.81,0:16:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been anyone tough enough\Nto get Zekken to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.73,0:17:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever does has my respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa, what happened\Nwhen you fought Zekken?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides losing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was going good till\Nour HPs dropped below 60%.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, Zekken beat me,\Nusing nothing but default skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.99,0:17:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't believe I\Nalmost forgot to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Zekin's race and\Nweapon of choice? An imp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.93,0:17:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main weapon's a one-handed sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about as skinny as your\Nrapier, Asuna, but only just.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Zekin's super fast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.77,0:17:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even see the\Nattacks coming at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's never happened to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still kind of shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A speed type, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.07,0:17:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had a hard time tracking\Nsecond, I doubt I'd be able to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.41,0:17:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know someone who might, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.69,0:17:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleepyhead's the fastest player I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you guys think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would Kirito go for\Nthat kind of challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.99,0:18:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.01,0:18:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, it's just\NKazuto already tried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And boy, did he lose spectacularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he holding back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of hard for me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From where I was standing,\Nit looked like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.61,0:18:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then I don't think I'm really the best\Nperson to judge whether he was or wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.15,0:18:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't use that dual-wielding\Ntrick, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess in a way, he\Nwasn't going all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.59,0:18:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's a duel in a normal game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for Kitty to do a fight\Nlike his life depended on it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.17,0:18:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only time he'll take a fight seriously\Nnow is if the game stops being a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.23,0:18:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the virtual world\Nbecomes the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a way, I hope he never goes\Nfull tilt in a battle ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's kind of had enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, heck, he gets into enough\Ntrouble on his own as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, from where I was standing,\NI got a different impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Kazuto was\Ndefinitely giving it his all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.37,0:19:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seemed serious and\Nfocused and determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He put up a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.33,0:19:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At one point, though,\Nsomething weird happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right before the duel was\Nover, they were locking swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, they both just stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like Kazuto was\Nsaying something to Zekken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't hear what\Nbecause of all the cheering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, all of a sudden, they\Nbacked off from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zekken charged him, but Kazuto couldn't\Ndodge it, and that's how the duel ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.65,0:19:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.93,0:19:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked him, but Kazuto wouldn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was, it must be pretty\Nimportant to keep to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.29,0:19:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:19:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the only way to find out\Nwhat he said is to ask Zekken myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're up to the challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing it because\NI think I can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about this second\Nperson intrigues me is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.03,0:20:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think this second person's\Nhere for reasons other than dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.29,0:20:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's what I think too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you want to find\Nout what it is, get ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you're going to have to put\Nup as good a fight as your boy Kirito,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.61,0:20:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.57,0:20:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you guys come cheer me on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.71,0:20:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know we will. It'll be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.91,0:20:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't miss it for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which character are\Nyou going to duel with?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.85,0:20:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have that\NSylph account, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll use this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Zekin's a speed type,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll probably come down to who can\Nhold out the longest rather than DPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.75,0:20:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, 3 o'clock on the island\Non Floor 24, right? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then if we meet here tomorrow\Nat 2.30, we can... Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already 6:00!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be late for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.05,0:21:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we might as well call\Nit a day and log out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rich girls and their problems, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's still asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, he didn't even feel a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.81,0:21:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Liz, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little while ago, you said you\Nthought Zekken converted over to ALO.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.99,0:21:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way you described the\Nduels got me thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could Zekken be someone from SAO?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the impression I got after my duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted a second opinion, so after Kirito\Nlost his, I asked him what he thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.85,0:21:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what did Kirito have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said that even though the\Nskills were through the roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zekin's definitely not a player from SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito also said that if\NZekken really was from SAO,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.95,0:21:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dual-wielding skill\Nwouldn't have gone to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:21:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have gone to Zekken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to show you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.57,0:22:30.42,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k21}Ma{\k20}chi {\k40}a{\k24}ka{\k57}ri {\k27}te{\k28}ra{\k30}shi{\k100}ta {\k19}ni{\k21}gi{\k20}ya{\k22}ka {\k21}na {\k45}wa{\k25}ra{\k32}i {\k27}go{\k23}e {\k83}to
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.57,0:22:30.42,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The street lights cast a glow on cheerful laughter
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.83,0:22:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what I want
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.42,0:22:35.04,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k51}Ro{\k44}ji{\k41}u{\k25}ra {\k39}no {\k49}a{\k52}shi{\k23}a{\k138}to
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.42,0:22:35.04,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And footprints in the back-alley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.63,0:22:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.37,0:22:38.48,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k30}Tsu{\k26}ta{\k18}e {\k27}ta{\k34}i {\k23}o{\k39}mo{\k21}i {\k93}wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.37,0:22:38.48,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wonder how much you understood of the feelings
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.48,0:22:41.63,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k29}Do{\k20}re {\k19}da{\k20}ke {\k22}to{\k41}do{\k22}i {\k59}tan {\k24}da{\k59}rou
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.48,0:22:41.63,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I've always wanted to convey to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.71,0:22:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.05,0:22:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always be able to confirm that.\NI'll always be able to confirm.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.63,0:22:47.47,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k39}I{\k28}tsu{\k30}mo {\k28}fu{\k43}ri {\k25}mu{\k32}i{\k21}te {\k46}ta{\k40}shi{\k38}ka{\k46}me{\k168}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.63,0:22:47.47,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I always turn around to you and make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.41,0:22:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long\Nyou are, but you are sure
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.26,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k15}I{\k27}tsu {\k37}da{\k38}tte {\k26}ma{\k22}yo{\k19}wa{\k54}zu
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.26,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Because no matter how I am,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.26,0:23:02.44,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k28}Ki{\k18}mi {\k38}wa {\k43}ki{\k43}tto {\k63}don{\k19}na {\k20}bo{\k21}ku {\k26}mo {\k54}oi{\k61}ka{\k64}ke{\k161}te {\k27}ku{\k14}re{\k65}ru {\k61}ka{\k192}ra
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.26,0:23:02.44,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I believe you'd always chase after me without any hesitation
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.05,0:22:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always be able to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always be able to see you.
